<title>USA: Stanley Works Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Stanley Works Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRITAIN, Conn. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		     $   0.41		   $ 0.33</p>
<p> Net			 36,700		   29,600</p>
<p> Revs		     646,600		  635,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  88,755		   88,815</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 net includes charge of $4.6 million.</p>
<p>Excluding restructuring and other charges, Q1 oper net was $40 million, or $0.45 per share vs $34 million, or $0.38 per share.</p>
</text>
